---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="How It Works | Arkansas Campaign Data Cooperative"
  description="How Arkansas campaigns combine Electd outreach, optional L2 enhanced data, managed services, and private campaign contacts."
  ogImage="/og/how-it-works.png"
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / How it works</p>
      <p class="brand-lockup">End-to-end path</p>
      <h1 transition:name="page-title">From data to doors to digital—in clear steps.</h1>
      <p class="hero-lede">
        Electd for execution. L2 for enhanced records (when the cooperative funds). Managed service when you need
        capacity. Private contacts stay yours.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-cinema section-cinema-light">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <p class="kicker">Operating sequence</p>
      <h2>Five moves that keep Arkansas campaigns coordinated.</h2>
      <ol class="steps stagger">
        <li>
          <strong>Start the platform</strong> Subscribe to Electd at $149/month—no contract. Work with SOS data plus
          your campaign contacts. <a href="/platform/">Platform details</a> ·
          <a href="https://www.electd.io/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">electd.io</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Optional: join the data cooperative</strong> Contribute by race type to fund L2-enhanced Arkansas
          records. <a href="/cooperative/">Tiers</a> · <a href="/data/">L2 overview</a> ·
          <a href="https://l2-data.com/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">l2-data.com</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Build lists &amp; execute</strong> Use Electd for email, SMS, voice, mail, canvassing, and phone
          banking—or hire us for managed sends. <a href="/pricing/">Rates</a> · <a href="/managed/">Managed</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Keep relationships private</strong> Campaign-owned contacts and notes stay firewalled.
          <a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Strengthen VAN if you use it</strong> Match and append—don’t rip and replace. <a href="/van/">VAN</a>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-cinema section-cinema-dark">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> Ready when you are</p>
      <h2>Walk the stack for your race type and budget.</h2>
      <p class="lead">Platform access, cooperative minimums, managed outreach, or a live demonstration—pick the next step.</p>
      <div class="cta-row" style="margin-top:1.5rem">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/join/?intent=demo">Book a demo</a>
        <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/pricing/">Review rates</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <div class="topic-grid stagger">
        <a class="topic-card accent" href="/join/?intent=demo">
          <h3>Book a demo</h3>
          <p>Walk through Electd + cooperative options for your race.</p>
          <span class="topic-go">Join →</span>
        </a>
        <a class="topic-card" href="/problem/">
          <h3>Why it matters</h3>
          <p>The cost of bad phones and emails.</p>
          <span class="topic-go">Problem →</span>
        </a>
        <a class="topic-card" href="/pricing/">
          <h3>Know the numbers</h3>
          <p>Quoted Electd usage vs managed rates.</p>
          <span class="topic-go">Rates →</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
